ust be modeled explicitly. Enactment alone does not fix them.\", \"The outcome includes nonpublic students although this grant mechanism applies to public schools.\"]}, {\"id\": \"not_enacted\", \"label\": \"American Teacher Act not enacted\", \"condition\": \"H.R. 2021 of the 119th Congress does not become law on or before 2027-01-14T23:59:59Z.\", \"assumptions\": [\"Other federal bills, state salary changes, substitute legislative vehicles and later enactment remain possible; this is not a no-policy-change scenario.\", \"Use the same common recovery/trend baseline and evidence as the enacted arm; any arm-specific adjustment must be explicit.\"]}], \"reference_description\": \"One common predictive starting distribution from the frozen NT history, persistence and explicit common recovery/trend assumptions. This reference is not a probability-weighted unconditional mixture of the two arms.\", \"condition_deadline\": \"2027-01-14T23:59:59Z\", \"condition_resolution_note\": \"No condition resolver is registered. The proposed rule requires the exact H.R. 2021 (119th Congress) official enacted-law association plus a dated BecameLaw action, cross-checked against the law publication. Another legislative vehicle, S. 2481 or a later Congress does not satisfy this identity. After cutoff, absence of enactment needs a fresh complete official record. Missing, contradictory or boundary-day evidence lacking sufficient timestamp precision stays unresolved. January 14 is a chosen scenario cutoff, not a claimed constitutional last-presentment date.\", \"exhaustive\": true, \"shared_history\": [{\"period\": \"2003\", \"value\": 277.563392032194, \"source_id\": \"naep-history\"}, {\"period\": \"2005\", \"value\": 278.819811032215, \"source_id\": \"naep-history\"}, {\"period\": \"2007\", \"value\": 281.34568687101, \"source_id\": \"naep-history\"}, {\"period\": \"2009\", \"value\": 282.909818195293, \"source_id\": \"naep-history\"}, {\"period\": \"2011\", \"value\": 283.851219074008, \